/*
  SocChart.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0148 · SocChart (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SocChart` resolves (table "SocChart") lives here with its web `t(key, default)`
